Subject: [PATCH] perf: collect validated attachment image URLs without field
 copies

Share attachment map validation and the legacy JSON fallback. Collect only the four URL strings for supported maps, preserving per-element marshaling order, typed attachments, nilness and output ownership.

Mattermax-Patch: attachment-image-map-reads.patch
